Memory Allocation Concept
ALLOC  -- Allocate a Block of Memory
IALLOC -- Initialize Memory Allocation System
:Memory Allocation Concept

     Thå concepô oæ memorù allocatioî witè theså routineó ió 
relativelù  simple®   Routineó  arå  provideä  tï  givå  thå 
programmeò   simplå  memorù  allocatioî   anä   deallocatioî 
capabilities¬ buô thå programmeò ió stilì iî control.

     Thå  basiã  ideá herå ió tï reservå á buffeò iî  memorù 
froí  whicè  tï takå bitó anä pieceó froí aô  á  time®   Thå 
boundinç  addresseó oæ thió buffeò arå specifieä (oò seô  bù 
default©  bù thå IALLOÃ routine¬  anä thå ALLOÃ  routinå  ió 
useä  tï obtaiî subbufferó froí thió largeò buffeò froí timå 
tï time®   ALLOÃ constantlù checkó tï seå iæ thå buffeò  haó 
enougè spacå lefô tï granô thå requesô foò á subbuffer¬ and¬ 
if it does, the subbuffer is provided.

     Thå largesô buffeò whicè maù bå reserveä bù thå  IALLOÃ 
routinå  ió  thaô buffeò whicè extendó froí thå enä  oæ  thå 
prograí  tï jusô belo÷ thå CCP®   Thió buffeò ió selecteä iæ 
IALLOÃ ió calleä witè A=0.


     Foò example¬  thå followinç illustrateó thå applicatioî 
using the largest buffer possible:

          XRA  A    ; Select Full Buffer
          CALL IALLOC
          ...
          LXI  D,1024    ; Request 1K
          CALL ALLOC
          JZ   MEMOVFL   ; Abort if Memory Overflow
          SHLD BUF1      ; Set Pointer to First Subbuffer
          ...
          LXI  D,36      ; Request 36 bytes
          CALL ALLOC
          JZ   MEMOVFL   ; Abort if Memory Overflow
          SHLD BUF2      ; Set Pointer to 2nd Subbuffer
          ...


     Thió memorù allocatioî schemå alsï permitó thå divisioî 
oæ  memorù  intï  á grouğ oæ buffers®   Onå  buffeò  maù  bå 
allocated¬  itó  addresó preserved¬  anotheò buffeò  maù  bå 
allocated¬  itó addresó preserved¬ anä theî subsequenô calló 
tï  IALLOÃ  maù bå useä tï selecô onå buffeò oò  thå  other®  
Eacè  calì tï IALLOÃ freeó thå entirå buffeò area¬  sï  carå 
should be taken in doing this.  For example:

          ...
          CALL CODEND    ; Use Codend as First Buffer
          SHLD BUF1
          XCHG           ; Address in DE
          LXI  H,1024    ; 1K for this buffer
          DAD  D         ; HL pts to after this buffer
          XCHG           ; HL is start, DE is end
          MVI  A,3       ; Select Start and End
          CALL IALLOC
          ...


IALLOC/ALLOC Example, Con't

          ...
          CALL ALLOC     ; Calls to ALLOC
          ...
          LHLD BUF1      ; Pt to 1st Buffer
          LXI  D,1024    ; Set 2nd Buffer
          DAD  D         ; Pt to 2nd Buffer
          SHLD BUF2
          XCHG
          DAD  D         ; Pt to end of 2nd Buffer (1K also)
          XCHG           ; HL is start, DE is end
          MVI  A,3       ; Select Start and End
          CALL IALLOC
          ...
          CALL ALLOC     ; Calls to ALLOC
          ...

